### ==============================
### CLIENTES
### ==============================

### Listar todos os clientes
GET http://localhost:8000/api/clientes/

### Criar cliente 1
POST http://localhost:8000/api/clientes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Carlos Silva",
    "email": "carlos@email.com",
    "telefone": "(84) 99123-4567"
}

### Criar cliente 2
POST http://localhost:8000/api/clientes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Maria Souza",
    "email": "maria@email.com",
    "telefone": "(84) 98765-4321"
}

### Buscar cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:8000/api/clientes/1/

### Atualizar cliente (PUT - substituição completa)
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/clientes/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Carlos Silva Atualizado",
    "email": "carlos.novo@email.com",
    "telefone": "(84) 91111-2222"
}

### Atualizar cliente parcialmente (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/clientes/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "telefone": "(84) 93333-4444"
}

### Deletar cliente
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/clientes/2/

